In Java 17, what does this program print?
```java
class Main {
  static class R implements AutoCloseable {
    public void close() { throw new IllegalStateException("close"); }
  }
  public static void main(String[] args) {
    try (R r = new R()) { throw new IllegalArgumentException("body"); }
    catch (Exception e) {
      System.out.print(e.getMessage() + ":" + e.getSuppressed()[0].getMessage());
    }
  }
}
```

